{"seq":3,"slug":"monads","title":"Monad 单子","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/haskell-pure-functional/abstractions/monads","wordCount":1038,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"monad-单子\">Monad 单子</h1><p>Monad 大概是编程界被神秘化得最严重的概念。各种「Monad 是 endofunctor 范畴里的幺半群」式玩笑，把一个其实很实用的工具吓退了无数人。本篇拒绝玄学路线：Monad 就是 <a href=\"functors-applicatives\">Functor 与 Applicative</a> 那道阶梯的第三级，专门解决 Applicative 解决不了的那件事——让后一步计算依赖前一步的结果。理解了这一句，剩下的都是细节。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>回忆 Applicative 的天花板：多步计算彼此独立。Monad 给出的新武器是 <code>&gt;&gt;=</code>（读作 bind）：它把「前一步的结果」喂给「一个返回新上下文计算的函数」，从而让控制流真正串起来、互相依赖。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[m a&lt;br/&gt;带上下文的值] --&gt; B[&quot;&gt;&gt;= bind&quot;]&#10;  C[&quot;函数 a -&gt; m b&lt;br/&gt;依赖前值的下一步&quot;] --&gt; B&#10;  B --&gt; D[m b&lt;br/&gt;串接后的上下文]&#10;  D --&gt; E[&quot;&gt;&gt;= 再串下一步&quot;]&#10;  F[纯值 a] --&gt; G[return / pure&lt;br/&gt;注入上下文]&#10;  G --&gt; A&#10;  E --&gt; H[do 记法&lt;br/&gt;语法糖串联]\">graph TD\n  A[m a&lt;br/&gt;带上下文的值] --&gt; B[\"&gt;&gt;= bind\"]\n  C[\"函数 a -&gt; m b&lt;br/&gt;依赖前值的下一步\"] --&gt; B\n  B --&gt; D[m b&lt;br/&gt;串接后的上下文]\n  D --&gt; E[\"&gt;&gt;= 再串下一步\"]\n  F[纯值 a] --&gt; G[return / pure&lt;br/&gt;注入上下文]\n  G --&gt; A\n  E --&gt; H[do 记法&lt;br/&gt;语法糖串联]</pre><p>层级再强调一次：Functor ⊂ Applicative ⊂ Monad，能力逐级增强。<code>&gt;&gt;=</code> 比 <code>&lt;*&gt;</code> 强的地方，全在那个「函数返回值依赖输入值」上。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>直觉</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>return</code>/<code>pure</code></td>\n<td><code>a -&gt; m a</code></td>\n<td>把纯值装进 Monad 上下文</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>&gt;&gt;=</code> (bind)</td>\n<td><code>m a -&gt; (a -&gt; m b) -&gt; m b</code></td>\n<td>取出结果喂给下一步（下一步可依赖它）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>&gt;&gt;</code></td>\n<td><code>m a -&gt; m b -&gt; m b</code></td>\n<td>串接但丢弃前一步结果</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>do</code> 记法</td>\n<td>语法糖</td>\n<td>把 <code>&gt;&gt;=</code> 链写成顺序代码块</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"bind-让步骤互相依赖\">bind：让步骤互相依赖</h2><p><code>Maybe</code> 的 Monad 实例最能说明问题。设想一串可能失败、且后续依赖前值的查找：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"haskell\" data-code=\"lookup&#39; :: Key -&gt; Maybe Val   -- 假定已有&#10;chain :: Maybe Val&#10;chain = lookup&#39; &quot;a&quot; &gt;&gt;= \\x -&gt;&#10;        lookup&#39; (toKey x) &gt;&gt;= \\y -&gt;   -- 注意：第二步的键依赖第一步结果 x&#10;        lookup&#39; (toKey y)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>lookup' :: Key -> Maybe Val   -- 假定已有</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>chain :: Maybe Val</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>chain = lookup' \"a\" >>= \\x -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        lookup' (toKey x) >>= \\y ->   -- 注意：第二步的键依赖第一步结果 x</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        lookup' (toKey y)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>第二次查找用的键 <code>toKey x</code> 来自第一次的结果——这是 Applicative 做不到的依赖。<code>&gt;&gt;=</code> 还顺手处理了短路：任何一步是 <code>Nothing</code>，整条链立刻塌成 <code>Nothing</code>，无需手写层层 <code>if</code>。每个 Monad 实例自定义「上下文如何串接」：<code>Maybe</code> 串接的是失败短路，列表串接的是非确定性分支，<code>State</code> 串接的是状态穿针引线。</p>\n<h2 id=\"do-记法-把-bind-写成顺序代码\">do 记法：把 bind 写成顺序代码</h2><p>裸写 <code>&gt;&gt;=</code> 加 lambda 很快变得难读。<code>do</code> 记法是它的语法糖，让带上下文的计算看起来像普通顺序代码：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"haskell\" data-code=\"chain :: Maybe Val&#10;chain = do&#10;  x &lt;- lookup&#39; &quot;a&quot;&#10;  y &lt;- lookup&#39; (toKey x)&#10;  lookup&#39; (toKey y)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>chain :: Maybe Val</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>chain = do</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  x &#x3C;- lookup' \"a\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  y &#x3C;- lookup' (toKey x)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  lookup' (toKey y)</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>x &lt;- expr</code> 脱糖成 <code>expr &gt;&gt;= \\x -&gt; ...</code>。<code>do</code> 记法是 Haskell 写 <a href=\"../practice/io-effects\">IO 与效应管理</a> 时最常见的形态——<code>main</code> 里那一行行看似命令式的代码，本质都是 <code>IO</code> Monad 的 <code>&gt;&gt;=</code> 串联。重要的是认清：<code>do</code> 不是引入了真正的命令式，它只是 Monad 的糖。</p>\n<h2 id=\"monad-法则\">Monad 法则</h2><p>和 Functor、Applicative 一样，Monad 实例必须满足三条法则，否则 <code>do</code> 记法的重构会出诡异错误：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>return </mtext><mi>a</mi><mo>≫</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mtext>  </mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>f</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>a</mi><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>左单位元</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{return}\\ a \\gg\\!= f \\;=\\; f\\ a \\quad(\\text{左单位元})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6542em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">return</span></span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≫</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">左单位元</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>≫</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>return</mtext><mtext>  </mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>m</mi><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>右单位元</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m \\gg\\!= \\text{return} \\;=\\; m \\quad(\\text{右单位元})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≫</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">return</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">右单位元</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>≫</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≫</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>g</mi><mtext>  </mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>m</mi><mo>≫</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>f</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>x</mi><mo>≫</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>结合律</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(m \\gg\\!= f) \\gg\\!= g \\;=\\; m \\gg\\!= (\\lambda x.\\ f\\ x \\gg\\!= g) \\quad(\\text{结合律})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≫</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≫</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≫</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">.</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≫</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">结合律</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>左右单位元说「<code>return</code> 不掺杂任何额外效应」，结合律说「串接的分组方式不影响结果」。它们承接 <a href=\"typeclasses\">类型类</a> 的「法则即契约」精神：合法的 Monad 才能让你安全地重排、提取 <code>do</code> 块里的步骤。</p>\n<h2 id=\"常见-monad-各司其职\">常见 Monad 各司其职</h2><p>Monad 的威力在于「同一套 <code>&gt;&gt;=</code>/<code>do</code> 接口，统一了形态各异的计算上下文」：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"haskell\" data-code=\"-- Maybe：可能失败，短路&#10;-- Either e：带错误信息的失败&#10;-- []：非确定性，组合所有可能&#10;-- State s：在计算间穿针引线一个可变状态（纯实现）&#10;-- Reader r：隐式只读环境（依赖注入）&#10;-- Writer w：累积日志/输出&#10;-- IO：与外部世界交互（见实践章）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>-- Maybe：可能失败，短路</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- Either e：带错误信息的失败</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- []：非确定性，组合所有可能</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- State s：在计算间穿针引线一个可变状态（纯实现）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- Reader r：隐式只读环境（依赖注入）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- Writer w：累积日志/输出</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- IO：与外部世界交互（见实践章）</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>State</code> 尤其值得一提：它在不破坏纯度的前提下模拟「可变状态」——状态被显式地作为值在 <code>&gt;&gt;=</code> 之间传递，只是被 Monad 藏到了背后。这正是 Haskell「用纯手段表达有状态计算」的代表作，把 <a href=\"../foundations/haskell-philosophy\">Haskell 哲学与纯函数式</a> 的纯度承诺贯彻到了有状态场景。</p>\n<h2 id=\"组合多个-monad-变换器一瞥\">组合多个 Monad：变换器一瞥</h2><p>真实程序常需同时拥有多种效应——既要 <code>IO</code>、又要状态、还要可能失败。直接嵌套会很痛苦，社区的经典答案是 Monad 变换器（如 <code>StateT</code>、<code>ExceptT</code>、<code>ReaderT</code>），把多层效应叠成一个组合 Monad。但变换器层数一多会有性能和心智负担，于是 2026 年仍有大量工作在探索更现代的效应系统（<code>effectful</code>、<code>polysemy</code>、<code>Bluefin</code> 等）作为替代。这条「如何优雅组合多种效应」的工程主线，留到 <a href=\"../practice/io-effects\">IO 与效应管理</a> 细讲。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Monad 是 Functor/Applicative 阶梯的第三级，独有能力是「后一步依赖前一步结果」。</li>\n<li><code>&gt;&gt;=</code>（bind）取出上下文中的值喂给下一步计算，每个实例自定义上下文如何串接。</li>\n<li><code>do</code> 记法是 <code>&gt;&gt;=</code> 的语法糖，让带上下文计算读起来像顺序代码，但并非真命令式。</li>\n<li>必须满足三条法则：左/右单位元与结合律，是安全重构 <code>do</code> 块的前提。</li>\n<li><code>Maybe</code>/<code>Either</code>/<code>[]</code>/<code>State</code>/<code>Reader</code>/<code>Writer</code>/<code>IO</code> 用同一接口统一了形态各异的上下文。</li>\n<li>多效应组合靠 Monad 变换器或现代效应系统，详见 <a href=\"../practice/io-effects\">IO 与效应管理</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Monad 单子","id":"monad-单子"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"bind：让步骤互相依赖","id":"bind-让步骤互相依赖"},{"level":2,"text":"do 记法：把 bind 写成顺序代码","id":"do-记法-把-bind-写成顺序代码"},{"level":2,"text":"Monad 法则","id":"monad-法则"},{"level":2,"text":"常见 Monad 各司其职","id":"常见-monad-各司其职"},{"level":2,"text":"组合多个 Monad：变换器一瞥","id":"组合多个-monad-变换器一瞥"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Functor 与 Applicative","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/haskell-pure-functional/abstractions/functors-applicatives"},"next":{"title":"代数数据类型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/haskell-pure-functional/type-system/algebraic-types"}}